u                 Preview undo of the latest operation               │
f                 Browse files changed in selected revision          │
Enter             Return to the selected revision preview            │
t                 Choose a theme, preview and save                   │
?                 Show this help                                     │
q / Ctrl-C        Quit                                               │
                                                                     │
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
